{
  "lesson_id": "b1-b2_reporting_verbs",
  "level": "B1-B2",
  "title": "Reporting verbs: Admit doing, refuse to do, etc.",
  "description": "Reporting verbs передают не только факт речи, но и способ/цель сообщения: agree, promise, admit, deny, suggest, advise и другие требуют разных patterns.",
  "theory": {
    "rule_id": "RULE-B1+-27-RU",
    "lesson_num": 27,
    "title": "Правила: Reporting verbs: Admit doing, refuse to do, etc.",
    "level": "B1-B2",
    "overview": "Reporting verbs передают не только факт речи, но и способ/цель сообщения: agree, promise, admit, deny, suggest, advise и другие требуют разных patterns.",
    "main_rule": "Разные verbs требуют разные конструкции: verb + to-infinitive, verb + -ing, verb + object + to-infinitive или that-clause.",
    "form": "Verb + to: agree/promise/refuse/offer + to V1. Verb + -ing: admit/deny/suggest/recommend + V-ing. Verb + object + to: advise/encourage/remind/warn + object + to V1. Some + that-clause.",
    "when_why": "Учи reporting verb вместе с pattern, а не отдельно.",
    "examples": "She agreed to help. → Она согласилась помочь.\nHe admitted making a mistake. → Он признал, что сделал ошибку.\nThey suggested taking a taxi. → Они предложили взять такси.\nShe advised me to wait. → Она посоветовала мне подождать.\nHe explained that the plan had changed. → Он объяснил, что план изменился.",
    "special_cases": "Suggest особенно важно: standard pattern is suggest + V-ing: She suggested taking a taxi.",
    "common_mistakes": "❌ She suggested to take a taxi. → ✅ She suggested taking a taxi.\n❌ He advised to wait. → ✅ He advised me to wait. (в этой модели нужен object)",
    "dont_confuse": "Значение verb не всегда подсказывает grammar pattern. Pattern нужно учить вместе с verb.",
    "quick_summary": "agree/promise/refuse/offer + to.\nadmit/deny/suggest/recommend + -ing.\nadvice/encourage/remind/warn + object + to.\nexplain/claim/admit + that-clause."
  },
